    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Inicio\"\ncss: category-page.css\nformat:\n  dashboard:\n    orientation: rows\n    scrolling: true\nexecute:\n  echo: false\n  warning: false\n  message: false\n---\n\n\n\nEl dashboard analiza el comercio internacional de tecnologías sanitarias en América Latina y el Caribe a partir de los datos de [CEPII-BACI](https://www.cepii.fr/DATA_DOWNLOAD/baci/doc/baci_webpage.html), con nomenclatura HS 2007.\n\nLos productos se clasificaron en siete categorías de uso común en la industria, cada una cuenta con una pestaña independiente en el dashboard:\n\n- Células humanas, tejidos y productos médicos de terapia avanzada.\n- Diagnósticos in vitro.\n- Dispositivos médicos.\n- Hemoderivados, antisueros y productos inmunobiológicos.\n- Ingredientes farmacéuticos activos.\n- Medicamentos.\n- Vacunas (humanas).\n\n\n\n```{=html}\n<section class=\"landing-kpi-section\">\n<h2>Tecnologías sanitarias</h2>\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-two-column\">\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-column landing-kpi-column-wide\">\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-card\">\n<h3>\n<a href=\"terapias-avanzadas.html\">Células humanas, tejidos y productos médicos de terapia avanzada</a>\n</h3>\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-grid\">\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-row landing-kpi-row-top\">\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-metric\">\n<span class=\"landing-kpi-metric-label\">Mercado total global</span>\n<strong class=\"landing-kpi-metric-value\">US$ 3,7 mil millones</strong>\n</div>\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-metric\">\n<span class=\"landing-kpi-metric-label\">CAGR 2007-2024</span>\n<strong class=\"landing-kpi-metric-value\">4,4%</strong>\n</div>\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-metric\">\n<span class=\"landing-kpi-metric-label\">CAGR últimos 5 años</span>\n<strong class=\"landing-kpi-metric-value\">-4,1%</strong>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-row landing-kpi-row-bottom\">\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-metric landing-kpi-metric-lac\">\n<span class=\"landing-kpi-metric-label\">Importaciones LAC 2024</span>\n<strong class=\"landing-kpi-metric-value\">US$ 0,2 mil millones</strong>\n</div>\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-metric landing-kpi-metric-lac\">\n<span class=\"landing-kpi-metric-label\">Exportaciones LAC 2024</span>\n<strong class=\"landing-kpi-metric-value\">US$ 0,1 mil millones</strong>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-card\">\n<h3>\n<a href=\"diagnosticos-in-vitro.html\">Diagnósticos in vitro</a>\n</h3>\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-grid\">\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-row landing-kpi-row-top\">\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-metric\">\n<span class=\"landing-kpi-metric-label\">Mercado total global</span>\n<strong class=\"landing-kpi-metric-value\">US$ 47,2 mil millones</strong>\n</div>\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-metric\">\n<span class=\"landing-kpi-metric-label\">CAGR 2007-2024</span>\n<strong class=\"landing-kpi-metric-value\">6,5%</strong>\n</div>\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-metric\">\n<span class=\"landing-kpi-metric-label\">CAGR últimos 5 años</span>\n<strong class=\"landing-kpi-metric-value\">9,3%</strong>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-row landing-kpi-row-bottom\">\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-metric landing-kpi-metric-lac\">\n<span class=\"landing-kpi-metric-label\">Importaciones LAC 2024</span>\n<strong class=\"landing-kpi-metric-value\">US$ 2,8 mil millones</strong>\n</div>\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-metric landing-kpi-metric-lac\">\n<span class=\"landing-kpi-metric-label\">Exportaciones LAC 2024</span>\n<strong class=\"landing-kpi-metric-value\">US$ 0,2 mil millones</strong>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-card\">\n<h3>\n<a href=\"hemoderivados-inmunobiologicos.html\">Hemoderivados, antisueros y productos inmunobiológicos</a>\n</h3>\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-grid\">\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-row landing-kpi-row-top\">\n<div class=\"landing-kpi-metric\">\n<span class=\"landing-kpi-metric-label\">Mercado total global</span>\n<strong class=\"landing-kpi-metric-value\">US$ 12,2 mil millones</strong>\n</div>\n<div class=\"lan